      "updated": 1787945435090,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Size that appears and cancels without ever being hit.\nNobody traded against it, so it proves nothing.\n\n\"120s at 1650s. Just watch them flash in and flash\nout. And we're not quite filling.\"\n                                             — 05-04 @37:58",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
