      "updated": 1787945435090,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Lots of volume printing, price going nowhere. If 400 contracts trade at one price in five seconds and the price is still that price — somebody refreshed.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Lots of volume printing, price going nowhere. If 400 contracts trade at one price in five seconds and the price is still that price — somebody refreshed.",
